1
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:41,920
The last ingredient

2
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,480
is the Soul-Severing Ginseng.

3
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,990
The veins of it

4
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:48,530
perfectly match the lines on my palm.

5
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:51,920
If your hand slips even slightly
when you cut it,

6
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,470
the ginseng's poison will kill you first.

7
00:01:07,090 --> 00:01:08,200
Back then, when I was in Jianghuai,

8
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:10,170
I set up a simple scam.

9
00:01:10,789 --> 00:01:12,070
But I never expected

10
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,170
the knockout drug I used

11
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,870
to be switched for poison.

12
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,050
What do you mean?

13
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,350
That's how your whole family

14
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:29,250
was wrongfully accused and suffered.

15
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,920
I remember I told you

16
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,950
who set it up.

17
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,070
What is it again?

18
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:43,539
Zhang Dancheng.

19
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,120
Right,

20
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,210
Zhang Dancheng.

21
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,200
I am Zhang Dancheng.

22
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,680
Your last enemy.

23
00:02:02,210 --> 00:02:02,840
Mentor,

24
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:06,460
are you kidding?

25
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,570
I'm just telling you the truth.

26
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,310
You can't be soft-hearted

27
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,250
when dealing with the Tianxiang Sect.

28
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:17,840
Being soft-hearted

29
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:21,280
will get you killed.

30
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:40,710
So you found me

31
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,540
and taught me

32
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,400
just to use me

33
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,800
to kill the Sect Master
to avenge yourself?

34
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,230
Exactly.

35
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:52,680
Exactly.

36
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,280
When we met

37
00:02:56,310 --> 00:02:57,470
8 years ago,

38
00:02:58,550 --> 00:03:00,320
this day was bound to come.

39
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:08,680
When I'm gone,

40
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,520
you must remember

41
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:12,280
how to walk

42
00:03:13,340 --> 00:03:14,200
the road ahead.

43
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,610
Zhang Dancheng.

44
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:04,470
After I kill the Sect Master,

45
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:10,080
I'll come back for your life.

46
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:11,970
OK.

47
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,750
OK.

48
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,130
Your training is complete.

49
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:20,839
It's time to set out.

50
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,870
But remember,

51
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,620
there's only one thing

52
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,680
that never changes.

53
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,320
The people closest to you

54
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:34,040
are

55
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,190
the most...

56
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,360
the most dangerous.

57
00:04:41,470 --> 00:04:42,730
The knife is in my hand.

58
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,320
I know how to use it.

59
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:52,830
Mentor.

60
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:30,150
[A Prophet]

61
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:33,400
[Episode 6]

62
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,480
How should I address you?

63
00:07:46,490 --> 00:07:47,850
You don't remember me?

64
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:51,150
That makes sense.

65
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:53,670
You've seen plenty of people like me.

66
00:07:54,330 --> 00:07:55,940
It's normal that you don't remember me.

67
00:07:55,940 --> 00:07:57,540
I definitely remember those

68
00:07:57,890 --> 00:07:59,490
who perform with me on stage.

69
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:01,390
But there are so many people

70
00:08:01,770 --> 00:08:03,300
in the audience,

71
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:05,740
so how could I possibly remember them all?

72
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:06,450
My

73
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:08,720
surname is Lyu.

74
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:10,860
Lyu Ruhui.

75
00:08:13,130 --> 00:08:14,500
Lyu Ruhui?

76
00:08:15,250 --> 00:08:16,850
Miss Jiang remembers me now?

77
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:21,060
Hui—when darkness reaches
its deepest, light is born.

78
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:22,210
That's a good name.

79
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:24,860
Judging by your outfit,

80
00:08:25,450 --> 00:08:26,330
what line

81
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:28,250
of work are you in?

82
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:30,470
Corpse Driving.

83
00:08:30,980 --> 00:08:33,039
If you've mastered corpse-driving,

84
00:08:33,330 --> 00:08:34,570
surely you can

85
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:37,140
read fortunes too, Mr. Lyu.

86
00:08:37,299 --> 00:08:38,429
I know a thing or two.

87
00:08:39,059 --> 00:08:40,850
Then could I trouble you

88
00:08:41,380 --> 00:08:42,299
to read

89
00:08:44,570 --> 00:08:45,690
my palm?

90
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:07,970
Miss Jiang,
you're blessed with good fortune.

91
00:09:07,970 --> 00:09:09,450
Your financial luck is good,

92
00:09:09,450 --> 00:09:10,810
and your romantic luck is strong, too.

93
00:09:10,810 --> 00:09:13,010
But you have too many crossroads ahead.

94
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:15,340
I'm afraid you won't live much longer.

95
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:17,900
Are you serious,

96
00:09:17,970 --> 00:09:18,730
Mr. Lyu?

97
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:22,180
Absolutely.

98
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:26,240
There are so many people outside.

99
00:09:26,310 --> 00:09:27,420
I advise you

100
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:29,520
not to be impulsive.

101
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:30,610
What?

102
00:09:31,450 --> 00:09:34,090
Do you think my fortune-telling
is inaccurate?

103
00:09:34,090 --> 00:09:35,220
No, you got it right.

104
00:09:36,330 --> 00:09:37,450
But in my opinion,

105
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:38,850
Mr. Lyu,

106
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,380
you missed one thing.

107
00:09:42,610 --> 00:09:43,730
What did I miss?

108
00:09:45,810 --> 00:09:47,270
I bring luck to my husband.

109
00:09:47,810 --> 00:09:49,540
Bringing luck to your husband?

110
00:09:49,690 --> 00:09:51,420
You must be joking, Miss Jiang.

111
00:09:51,780 --> 00:09:54,310
Are you sure you're not a jinx
to your husband?

112
00:09:54,420 --> 00:09:55,810
If I were a jinx,

113
00:09:56,380 --> 00:09:57,260
sir,

114
00:09:57,900 --> 00:10:00,430
how are you still sitting here
safe and sound?

115
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:04,740
You even have the army at your disposal.

116
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:06,260
Miss Jiang,

117
00:10:07,210 --> 00:10:08,300
it's been 8 years,

118
00:10:09,260 --> 00:10:11,520
and you've certainly risen in the world.

119
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:15,710
Whether I've risen or not
doesn't matter.

120
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:17,740
What matters is, you've fallen

121
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:18,660
so low that

122
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:20,790
even a dog can take a bite out of you now.

123
00:10:23,330 --> 00:10:24,610
Then please tell me,

124
00:10:25,570 --> 00:10:26,330
is this dog

125
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,450
blind

126
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:29,900
or not?

127
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:36,980
I think you're the blind one.

128
00:10:38,970 --> 00:10:41,540
You don't even know
whose corpses you're transporting.

129
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:43,270
Corpse Driving is just a cover.

130
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:46,020
It's actually opium inside.

131
00:10:46,130 --> 00:10:47,730
Commander Feng

132
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:50,160
has always hated opium like the plague.

133
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:52,690
If he finds out

134
00:10:53,490 --> 00:10:56,780
you're using his fallen soldiers' bodies
to smuggle opium,

135
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:58,240
what do you think he'll do?

136
00:11:00,180 --> 00:11:01,260
Now you finally know

137
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:02,330
why Blind Du

138
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:04,760
let you drive the corpses, right?

139
00:11:05,810 --> 00:11:07,870
If you don't want to be his scapegoat,

140
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:08,970
just play along

141
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:11,380
with me in this act.

142
00:11:15,210 --> 00:11:17,730
You'd better
think this through, Miss Jiang.

143
00:11:17,730 --> 00:11:18,930
When this act is over,

144
00:11:19,090 --> 00:11:20,150
if I'm still alive,

145
00:11:22,570 --> 00:11:23,610
you will be dead.

146
00:11:28,820 --> 00:11:30,750
Let's see if you can survive first.

147
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,140
Why are you helping me?

148
00:11:48,730 --> 00:11:49,850
You're

149
00:11:49,850 --> 00:11:52,250
accusing my regiment colonel
and adjutant

150
00:11:52,330 --> 00:11:55,530
of using my fallen soldiers' corpses
to transport opium.

151
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:59,000
If it were anyone else,
they'd already be dead.

152
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:01,140
But why are you still alive?

153
00:12:01,850 --> 00:12:03,910
Please see clearly, Commander Feng.

154
00:12:11,610 --> 00:12:14,140
What's your relationship
with Jiang Feiyan?

155
00:12:18,090 --> 00:12:19,810
She's just an old friend of mine.

156
00:12:19,810 --> 00:12:21,210
You don't want to tell me?

157
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:31,070
What happened today

158
00:12:31,310 --> 00:12:33,420
is bound to put them on their guard.

159
00:12:35,310 --> 00:12:37,500
If I can't catch them red-handed,

160
00:12:38,210 --> 00:12:40,540
I won't be able to answer
to the Commander.

161
00:12:40,540 --> 00:12:42,270
Rest assured, Commander Feng.

162
00:12:43,450 --> 00:12:45,450
I can make sure you catch them all,

163
00:12:46,090 --> 00:12:47,350
leaving no loose ends.

164
00:12:50,380 --> 00:12:51,310
Tell me about it.

165
00:12:52,420 --> 00:12:53,090
Kill me.

166
00:13:04,490 --> 00:13:05,970
Being able to wipe out these scumbags

167
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:07,450
so thoroughly this time,

168
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,190
I really have to thank you

169
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:11,620
and that old friend of yours.

170
00:13:11,850 --> 00:13:12,730
Old friend?

171
00:13:14,780 --> 00:13:15,940
He told you that?

172
00:13:16,450 --> 00:13:18,450
He's not really an old friend, is he?

173
00:13:19,660 --> 00:13:20,300
Yes.

174
00:13:21,330 --> 00:13:22,390
He's an old friend.

175
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,870
Why aren't you drinking, Commander Feng?

176
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:31,730
Something's on your mind again?

177
00:13:31,730 --> 00:13:32,810
What's on my mind?

178
00:13:35,180 --> 00:13:36,330
There are too many scumbags

179
00:13:36,330 --> 00:13:39,140
like Lei San in this world.
That weighs on me.

180
00:13:39,490 --> 00:13:42,060
And the higher-ups deliberately
won't let me wipe out

181
00:13:42,060 --> 00:13:44,020
those damn swindlers in Longxuya.

182
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:45,450
That weighs on me, too.

183
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,430
Commander Feng,
you care deeply about your country,

184
00:13:48,430 --> 00:13:50,090
and you have lofty ambitions.

185
00:13:50,340 --> 00:13:51,530
It's just

186
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:53,750
that the time is not right yet.

187
00:13:54,260 --> 00:13:55,830
If you trust me,

188
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,600
I hope I can help you

189
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,580
realize your ambitions.

190
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:48,590
Aren't you afraid I poisoned it?

191
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:51,080
Death is death. No matter

192
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:52,730
who kills me or how.

193
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:55,590
At least I'll die on a full stomach.

194
00:14:55,730 --> 00:14:56,790
It's not a bad deal.

195
00:14:58,330 --> 00:15:00,130
You really take death in stride.

196
00:15:01,300 --> 00:15:02,090
Kid,

197
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:04,060
since you brought me this meal,

198
00:15:04,610 --> 00:15:06,670
I'll read your fortune one more time.

199
00:15:08,690 --> 00:15:10,940
By the Nanxi River,

200
00:15:12,380 --> 00:15:15,450
against the current, the corpses go.

201
00:15:23,210 --> 00:15:23,900
Kid,

202
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:27,180
from the first day you came
looking for me at Longxuya,

203
00:15:28,530 --> 00:15:30,340
I knew who you were.

204
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,570
You haven't

205
00:15:32,570 --> 00:15:34,940
changed much in 8 years.

206
00:15:35,730 --> 00:15:37,160
If you recognized me,

207
00:15:39,690 --> 00:15:40,940
why didn't you kill me?

208
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:42,600
Killing you would be too easy.

209
00:15:43,300 --> 00:15:44,380
I kept you alive

210
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,630
to draw out the person behind you.

211
00:15:57,090 --> 00:15:58,900
Three Yin converge to summon misfortune.

212
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:00,570
Time to close the net.

213
00:16:00,970 --> 00:16:01,900
Zhang Dancheng,

214
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:03,170
I know you're there.

215
00:16:04,490 --> 00:16:06,220
We were once fellow disciples.

216
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:08,320
Let me tell you something.

217
00:16:08,970 --> 00:16:10,890
About what happened
with the Wang family back then,

218
00:16:10,890 --> 00:16:12,800
you thought I had set you up.

219
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:14,220
It was the Sect Master

220
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:17,560
who had the Qian family replace
the knockout drops with poison.

221
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:19,890
He wanted you to be the one to kill.

222
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:21,810
Didn't you live by the rules

223
00:16:21,810 --> 00:16:23,630
and refuse to break them
even if it meant death?

224
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:26,200
So he used your own rules to destroy you.

225
00:16:26,780 --> 00:16:27,780
To put it bluntly,

226
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,150
neither of us

227
00:16:29,170 --> 00:16:31,410
can escape the Sect Master's grasp.

228
00:16:31,850 --> 00:16:33,580
We're both pawns he discarded.

229
00:16:40,970 --> 00:16:42,260
This wine

230
00:16:42,330 --> 00:16:45,570
tastes like the drug the Qian family
used back then.

231
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:48,000
It's quite bitter.

232
00:16:58,670 --> 00:16:59,380
Fine.

233
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:01,020
Kid,

234
00:17:01,330 --> 00:17:02,450
for this wine,

235
00:17:02,740 --> 00:17:05,339
I'll read your Mentor's fortune
one more time.

236
00:17:29,970 --> 00:17:31,490
Kan means danger.

237
00:17:32,140 --> 00:17:33,870
The Lake over Water—hardship.

238
00:17:34,580 --> 00:17:36,180
The fourth line is changing.

239
00:17:37,620 --> 00:17:39,490
Your fate is trapped by stone,

240
00:17:40,490 --> 00:17:42,690
and your soul clings to moss.

241
00:17:44,530 --> 00:17:45,660
Zhang Dancheng,

242
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:47,770
your fate is worse than mine.

243
00:17:48,290 --> 00:17:50,290
You'll die a worse death than I will!

244
00:17:56,810 --> 00:17:58,810
You've read fortunes all your life.

245
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:01,790
Did you foresee dying here today?

246
00:18:02,290 --> 00:18:05,250
I read life, not death.

247
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,820
I read other people's fates, not my own.

248
00:18:20,860 --> 00:18:23,120
I've pretended to be blind my whole life.

249
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:27,530
Now I really can't see.

250
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:26,340
I came from the mortal realm
to practice physiognomy.

251
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:29,100
Everything in the mortal world
is already in the past.

252
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:31,730
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn,
but the wind cannot be driven away.

253
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:34,930
In life and death,
it's all within the art of physiognomy.

254
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:40,290
Nobody moves!

255
00:20:40,970 --> 00:20:41,970
Nobody moves!

256
00:21:27,290 --> 00:21:29,770
[Longxuya]

257
00:21:28,450 --> 00:21:30,050
I joined the army at sixteen.

258
00:21:30,380 --> 00:21:33,210
I've fought my way through piles
of corpses to get where I am today.

259
00:21:33,210 --> 00:21:34,540
I don't believe in fate.

260
00:21:37,450 --> 00:21:38,780
I only believe in my gun.

261
00:21:50,380 --> 00:21:51,040
Commander,

262
00:21:51,210 --> 00:21:52,100
the remnants of Longxuya

263
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:53,100
have all been arrested.

264
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:53,960
Those who dared to resist

265
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,160
were shot on the spot.

266
00:22:16,620 --> 00:22:17,420
You stay here.

267
00:22:17,580 --> 00:22:18,110
Yes, sir.

268
00:22:32,250 --> 00:22:33,940
Blind Du died last night.

269
00:22:34,530 --> 00:22:36,140
I heard

270
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:40,950
you two met before that.

271
00:22:42,970 --> 00:22:43,730
If the higher-ups come asking,

272
00:22:43,730 --> 00:22:44,900
I'll need an answer.

273
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:48,980
I might have to borrow your life for that.

274
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:53,960
Commander Feng

275
00:22:54,490 --> 00:22:56,020
never leaves a root behind.

276
00:22:56,360 --> 00:22:57,490
But you should know,

277
00:22:58,010 --> 00:22:58,940
I'm not the root

278
00:22:59,050 --> 00:22:59,860
of this.

279
00:23:00,820 --> 00:23:02,080
Killing me won't help.

280
00:23:02,620 --> 00:23:03,900
Then where is the root?

281
00:23:26,250 --> 00:23:27,100
Spare me, sir!

282
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:27,730
We're all

283
00:23:27,900 --> 00:23:29,100
in the same business.

284
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:30,230
What happened?

285
00:23:38,100 --> 00:23:38,770
Liang,

286
00:23:40,180 --> 00:23:41,180
I toast to you.

287
00:23:41,210 --> 00:23:41,690
Come on.

288
00:23:47,620 --> 00:23:48,450
Fill it up.

289
00:23:49,770 --> 00:23:50,420
Come on.

290
00:23:53,970 --> 00:23:54,900
Liang,

291
00:23:56,010 --> 00:23:58,010
thanks for taking care of me lately.

292
00:23:58,660 --> 00:23:59,970
Take this money.

293
00:24:01,620 --> 00:24:02,750
We're parting ways.

294
00:24:03,970 --> 00:24:04,580
What?

295
00:24:05,380 --> 00:24:06,510
You said something?

296
00:24:07,530 --> 00:24:08,860
We're not parting ways.

297
00:24:12,210 --> 00:24:14,610
The road I'm taking next
is very dangerous.

298
00:24:16,100 --> 00:24:18,050
It'll only make things harder
if I take you with me.

299
00:24:18,050 --> 00:24:19,210
If it's dangerous,

300
00:24:19,530 --> 00:24:20,770
then you need me with you even more.

301
00:24:20,770 --> 00:24:23,100
Don't you know what I'm capable of?

302
00:24:57,580 --> 00:24:58,660
They call me

303
00:24:59,490 --> 00:25:00,140
Tongbei

304
00:25:00,730 --> 00:25:01,730
Little Spinning Top.

305
00:25:01,730 --> 00:25:02,420
Alright.

306
00:25:02,420 --> 00:25:03,660
Liang,

307
00:25:03,730 --> 00:25:05,140
I know you're capable.

308
00:25:05,250 --> 00:25:05,900
Sit down.

309
00:25:05,900 --> 00:25:06,580
Now you know, right?

310
00:25:06,580 --> 00:25:06,940
Sit.

311
00:25:13,210 --> 00:25:15,870
You saw what happened
to the people in Longxuya.

312
00:25:16,530 --> 00:25:17,210
Liang,

313
00:25:19,690 --> 00:25:21,690
being a swindler can get you killed.

314
00:25:25,100 --> 00:25:26,360
I don't want you to die.

315
00:25:28,580 --> 00:25:29,530
But my parents

316
00:25:30,010 --> 00:25:31,380
weren't swindlers.

317
00:25:32,090 --> 00:25:33,290
Why did they both die?

318
00:25:39,210 --> 00:25:41,010
Anyway, in this world,

319
00:25:41,580 --> 00:25:42,640
just staying alive

320
00:25:42,660 --> 00:25:43,580
isn't easy.

321
00:25:44,490 --> 00:25:45,580
If it's not easy,

322
00:25:47,140 --> 00:25:48,800
shouldn't we try to live well?

323
00:25:52,940 --> 00:25:53,900
Listen to me,

324
00:25:54,660 --> 00:25:56,120
leave the Tianxiang Sect.

325
00:25:56,770 --> 00:25:57,770
Their people

326
00:25:58,940 --> 00:26:00,100
never end up well.

327
00:26:02,490 --> 00:26:04,690
Aren't we both from the Tianxiang Sect?

328
00:26:05,450 --> 00:26:07,450
Then look at what they've done to us.

329
00:26:07,580 --> 00:26:08,510
What did they do?

330
00:26:09,250 --> 00:26:10,940
They made us scapegoats.

331
00:26:12,420 --> 00:26:13,420
That's exactly

332
00:26:13,490 --> 00:26:14,940
why I have to follow you!

333
00:26:15,690 --> 00:26:16,620
You're capable,

334
00:26:16,620 --> 00:26:18,450
and you won't use me as a scapegoat.

335
00:26:18,450 --> 00:26:19,450
I'm telling you, bro,

336
00:26:19,450 --> 00:26:20,450
whatever you do from now on,

337
00:26:20,450 --> 00:26:21,580
I'm coming with you.

338
00:26:24,660 --> 00:26:26,860
What if I wanted to kill the Sect Master?

339
00:26:32,250 --> 00:26:33,240
Don't talk nonsense.

340
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:33,860
Ruhui.

341
00:26:33,890 --> 00:26:35,490
You don't have what it takes.

342
00:26:39,450 --> 00:26:40,180
Liang,

343
00:26:42,820 --> 00:26:44,420
my real name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

344
00:26:48,770 --> 00:26:50,570
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

345
00:27:02,550 --> 00:27:05,030
I'm not the root of this.

346
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:07,110
Killing me won't help.

347
00:27:07,580 --> 00:27:09,010
Then where is the root?

348
00:27:09,970 --> 00:27:10,940
The true root

349
00:27:11,610 --> 00:27:13,040
is the buyer behind it all—

350
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:14,700
[Mingcao Hall]

351
00:27:13,490 --> 00:27:14,430
the Qian family

352
00:27:14,940 --> 00:27:15,870
of Mingcao Hall.

353
00:27:31,250 --> 00:27:31,690
Sir,

354
00:27:31,970 --> 00:27:33,420
what herbs are you looking for?

355
00:27:33,420 --> 00:27:34,480
I'm just browsing.

356
00:27:37,580 --> 00:27:40,110
I hear this mountain
has plenty of fine herbs.

357
00:27:43,940 --> 00:27:44,450
Sir,

358
00:27:44,770 --> 00:27:46,210
you must be from out of town.

359
00:27:46,210 --> 00:27:47,940
Most of the purple dendrobium

360
00:27:48,050 --> 00:27:49,980
you see on the market comes from us.

361
00:27:50,730 --> 00:27:51,790
Purple dendrobium

362
00:27:51,970 --> 00:27:53,970
is worth its weight in gold these days.

363
00:27:53,970 --> 00:27:55,100
You have it in stock?

364
00:27:55,250 --> 00:27:56,050
Just a moment.

365
00:28:08,010 --> 00:28:09,070
Please take a look.

366
00:28:16,530 --> 00:28:17,860
It's indeed excellent.

367
00:28:18,820 --> 00:28:20,420
How much are you looking for?

368
00:28:21,820 --> 00:28:22,950
How much do you have?

369
00:28:24,180 --> 00:28:24,940
We have

370
00:28:25,140 --> 00:28:26,250
about 100 jins in stock.

371
00:28:26,250 --> 00:28:27,310
Can you take it all?

372
00:28:35,380 --> 00:28:36,580
I came from Nanyang.

373
00:28:36,770 --> 00:28:37,580
I'm planning

374
00:28:37,690 --> 00:28:39,380
to buy a batch of good medicinal herbs
to take back.

375
00:28:39,380 --> 00:28:41,040
If your herbs are good enough,

376
00:28:41,050 --> 00:28:43,050
we can establish a long-term partnership

377
00:28:43,050 --> 00:28:45,110
and do business together regularly.

378
00:28:45,820 --> 00:28:47,350
Let's talk somewhere else.

379
00:28:49,380 --> 00:28:49,970
Bro,

380
00:28:50,420 --> 00:28:53,580
a thousand cups of wine
are never enough with a true friend.

381
00:28:53,580 --> 00:28:55,380
I really feel a connection with you.

382
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:56,140
I wonder

383
00:28:56,690 --> 00:28:58,210
if these three gold bars

384
00:28:58,450 --> 00:29:00,250
can make up for some of the goodwill

385
00:29:00,250 --> 00:29:01,980
you have earned with your wife.

386
00:29:02,210 --> 00:29:02,820
Bro,

387
00:29:04,010 --> 00:29:05,410
let me tell you the truth.

388
00:29:05,620 --> 00:29:06,660
Three gold bars

389
00:29:06,820 --> 00:29:07,860
are indeed

390
00:29:08,140 --> 00:29:09,530
a lot of money to me.

391
00:29:10,690 --> 00:29:11,450
But

392
00:29:11,900 --> 00:29:13,530
to my wife's family,

393
00:29:14,100 --> 00:29:15,180
it's just a drop

394
00:29:15,580 --> 00:29:16,530
in the bucket.

395
00:29:19,140 --> 00:29:21,870
I traveled all the way from Nanyang
to your place,

396
00:29:22,490 --> 00:29:23,660
not for

397
00:29:23,730 --> 00:29:25,390
a small deal of a few gold bars.

398
00:29:26,970 --> 00:29:27,900
What I want

399
00:29:30,010 --> 00:29:31,580
is the bucket.

400
00:29:34,940 --> 00:29:36,730
And what exactly is this "bucket"

401
00:29:36,730 --> 00:29:39,250
you're talking about, Chengming?

402
00:29:47,380 --> 00:29:49,290
The Qian family's Bashen Powder.

403
00:29:56,820 --> 00:29:57,450
My friend,

404
00:29:57,450 --> 00:29:58,510
don't joke around.

405
00:29:58,620 --> 00:29:59,480
The Qian family

406
00:29:59,530 --> 00:30:01,190
has been practicing medicine

407
00:30:01,580 --> 00:30:03,100
and dealing in herbs for generations.

408
00:30:03,100 --> 00:30:04,530
We've never had anything to do

409
00:30:04,530 --> 00:30:05,900
with the stuff you mentioned.

410
00:30:05,900 --> 00:30:07,010
I heard

411
00:30:07,660 --> 00:30:10,620
the Qian family's supply routes
have run into some trouble.

412
00:30:10,620 --> 00:30:12,480
You can't get the raw materials in

413
00:30:12,690 --> 00:30:14,220
and can't get the goods out.

414
00:30:18,490 --> 00:30:19,580
I can

415
00:30:20,420 --> 00:30:23,280
not only keep supplying
the Qian family with opium,

416
00:30:23,380 --> 00:30:25,580
but also sell Bashen Powder in Nanyang.

417
00:30:25,690 --> 00:30:27,100
With goods coming in and going out,

418
00:30:27,100 --> 00:30:29,960
you'll solve the Qian family's
immediate problem.

419
00:30:30,620 --> 00:30:32,340
And you'll definitely
be able to stand tall

420
00:30:32,340 --> 00:30:33,540
in front of your wife.

421
00:30:33,900 --> 00:30:35,380
You came prepared.

422
00:30:35,490 --> 00:30:37,010
Of course.

423
00:30:37,340 --> 00:30:39,200
Wenxin, you always keep your word

424
00:30:39,380 --> 00:30:41,110
and never shortchange anyone.

425
00:30:41,730 --> 00:30:44,450
Liuwei Dihuang pills have honey in them.

426
00:30:44,450 --> 00:30:47,180
When they come into contact with water,
their surface becomes sticky.

427
00:30:47,180 --> 00:30:49,580
But the surface of your pills
is dry and hard.

428
00:30:49,580 --> 00:30:52,100
These are pills made
with white sugar, right?

429
00:30:52,100 --> 00:30:53,820
The prescriptions passed down
from our ancestors

430
00:30:53,820 --> 00:30:55,100
must be followed exactly.

431
00:30:55,100 --> 00:30:56,380
The Qian family's reputation
over the years

432
00:30:56,380 --> 00:30:58,730
has been built up
bit by bit by you, Wenxin.

433
00:31:00,530 --> 00:31:02,390
I came all this way to do business.

434
00:31:02,620 --> 00:31:04,180
If I didn't come to you,

435
00:31:04,490 --> 00:31:06,290
wouldn't I be going out of my way?

436
00:31:06,730 --> 00:31:08,530
It's nothing worth mentioning.

437
00:31:14,210 --> 00:31:15,580
Looking at your face,

438
00:31:16,100 --> 00:31:17,290
you have a broad forehead

439
00:31:17,290 --> 00:31:18,890
and a prominent nose bridge.

440
00:31:18,970 --> 00:31:21,030
It's clearly a face of great fortune.

441
00:31:21,180 --> 00:31:22,580
If I'm not mistaken,

442
00:31:22,940 --> 00:31:23,900
Wenxin,

443
00:31:24,250 --> 00:31:26,690
you are the real source
of the Qian family's wealth.

444
00:31:26,690 --> 00:31:29,010
My friend,
you really know how to read people.

445
00:31:29,010 --> 00:31:31,050
My wife believes in this deeply.

446
00:31:31,050 --> 00:31:33,380
She has hired many masters
to read my face.

447
00:31:33,660 --> 00:31:34,530
They all said

448
00:31:34,900 --> 00:31:36,300
that I would bring wealth

449
00:31:37,140 --> 00:31:38,140
to the Qian family.

450
00:31:38,140 --> 00:31:41,010
And now I'm here,
bringing you more wealth.

451
00:31:41,580 --> 00:31:43,250
If we join forces,

452
00:31:43,380 --> 00:31:45,980
once Bashen Powder
starts selling in Nanyang,

453
00:31:46,100 --> 00:31:47,050
you won't

454
00:31:48,180 --> 00:31:50,510
have to answer to the Qian family anymore.

455
00:31:54,970 --> 00:31:56,140
Bashen Powder

456
00:31:56,970 --> 00:31:58,180
isn't mine to decide.

457
00:32:04,660 --> 00:32:06,590
Whether it's honey or white sugar,

458
00:32:06,770 --> 00:32:08,290
it's only a minor ingredient.

459
00:32:08,290 --> 00:32:09,690
It won't affect the efficacy.

460
00:32:09,690 --> 00:32:10,900
You changed the prescription
without authorization.

461
00:32:10,900 --> 00:32:12,580
How do you know it won't
affect the medicine?

462
00:32:12,580 --> 00:32:14,440
The Second Master approved this.

463
00:32:20,140 --> 00:32:21,010
It seems

464
00:32:23,300 --> 00:32:25,120
the son-in-law is still an outsider.

465
00:32:25,120 --> 00:32:26,280
Bashen Powder

466
00:32:27,290 --> 00:32:29,140
isn't mine to decide alone.

467
00:32:41,940 --> 00:32:43,470
We have guests in our house.

468
00:32:47,010 --> 00:32:47,730
Liang.

469
00:32:47,940 --> 00:32:50,200
No one could pull off this outfit but you.

470
00:32:51,210 --> 00:32:52,250
From now on,

471
00:32:52,530 --> 00:32:54,450
you are Master Chang Youliang,

472
00:32:54,450 --> 00:32:55,770
the 13th-generation successor

473
00:32:55,770 --> 00:32:57,250
of Zijin Temple on Mount Heyun.

474
00:32:57,250 --> 00:32:59,690
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

475
00:32:59,730 --> 00:33:02,050
You really nailed the tone and vibe.

476
00:33:02,180 --> 00:33:04,210
With my acting skills,

477
00:33:04,340 --> 00:33:06,470
I could make a living on stage for real.

478
00:33:08,420 --> 00:33:10,340
Where are we working today?

479
00:33:10,940 --> 00:33:11,870
The Qian family.

480
00:33:12,010 --> 00:33:12,940
The Qian family?

481
00:33:13,140 --> 00:33:13,770
What's their business?

482
00:33:13,770 --> 00:33:14,630
Do you remember

483
00:33:14,690 --> 00:33:16,350
whose opium we were smuggling

484
00:33:16,420 --> 00:33:18,020
when we drove those corpses?

485
00:33:18,380 --> 00:33:20,240
Then they are no ordinary family.

486
00:33:20,660 --> 00:33:22,140
Then they're no ordinary marks.

487
00:33:22,140 --> 00:33:22,620
So,

488
00:33:22,770 --> 00:33:24,430
you must promise me one thing.

489
00:33:25,100 --> 00:33:26,530
If I sense danger,

490
00:33:27,010 --> 00:33:28,690
I'll yell "dumb mark" at you.

491
00:33:29,530 --> 00:33:30,590
When that happens,

492
00:33:30,900 --> 00:33:31,730
just run

493
00:33:32,290 --> 00:33:33,250
and leave me behind.

494
00:33:33,250 --> 00:33:33,820
Wait,

495
00:33:34,620 --> 00:33:36,290
we're usually the ones who con the marks.

496
00:33:36,290 --> 00:33:37,530
Aren't you just insulting me?

497
00:33:37,530 --> 00:33:38,590
Pick another word.

498
00:33:39,820 --> 00:33:40,970
Sometimes,

499
00:33:40,970 --> 00:33:42,210
it's hard to tell

500
00:33:42,490 --> 00:33:43,420
who's the prey.

501
00:33:44,660 --> 00:33:45,460
Master Chang,

502
00:33:45,970 --> 00:33:47,940
this is my husband, Zhou Wenxin.

503
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:50,420
T-This is my wife.

504
00:33:51,820 --> 00:33:52,820
What are you waiting for?

505
00:33:52,820 --> 00:33:54,750
You want me to serve you a cup of tea?

506
00:33:54,940 --> 00:33:56,100
We're not drinking.

507
00:33:56,230 --> 00:33:57,230
This way, please.

508
00:34:04,290 --> 00:34:05,210
Here.

509
00:34:07,420 --> 00:34:08,300
Master Chang,

510
00:34:08,610 --> 00:34:09,770
this is my Four Pillars of Destiny.

511
00:34:09,770 --> 00:34:11,170
Please take a look.

512
00:34:11,900 --> 00:34:13,699
Has something happened at home?

513
00:34:16,860 --> 00:34:18,420
I took a quick look.

514
00:34:19,380 --> 00:34:21,610
Something is off
about the courtyard's layout.

515
00:34:21,610 --> 00:34:22,739
If I'm not mistaken,

516
00:34:23,010 --> 00:34:24,940
the wealth position has been compromised.

517
00:34:24,940 --> 00:34:26,489
For merchants,

518
00:34:26,650 --> 00:34:29,090
a compromised wealth position
can have varying consequences.

519
00:34:29,090 --> 00:34:30,900
It could mean losing wealth,

520
00:34:31,170 --> 00:34:32,090
or

521
00:34:32,739 --> 00:34:34,170
even the destruction of your family.

522
00:34:34,170 --> 00:34:35,830
The destruction of my family?

523
00:34:35,860 --> 00:34:36,900
Master,

524
00:34:37,090 --> 00:34:38,620
is there a solution to this?

525
00:34:38,860 --> 00:34:41,050
Since ancient times,
power and wealth have been inseparable.

526
00:34:41,050 --> 00:34:42,420
A damaged wealth position

527
00:34:42,420 --> 00:34:45,219
can only be resolved by someone

528
00:34:45,530 --> 00:34:46,900
with military power.

529
00:34:48,010 --> 00:34:49,530
Military power....

530
00:34:49,820 --> 00:34:51,610
You mean someone in the military?

531
00:34:51,610 --> 00:34:53,380
Where am I supposed to find

532
00:34:53,610 --> 00:34:54,780
such a person?

533
00:34:54,900 --> 00:34:56,650
Looking at your Four Pillars of Destiny,

534
00:34:56,650 --> 00:34:59,860
you should have close ties to someone

535
00:35:00,010 --> 00:35:01,340
of considerable rank and influence.

536
00:35:01,340 --> 00:35:02,130
Pay

537
00:35:02,260 --> 00:35:04,860
more attention to the people
around you recently.

538
00:35:04,860 --> 00:35:05,780
There should be

539
00:35:05,860 --> 00:35:07,940
a benefactor who can help you.

540
00:35:09,010 --> 00:35:09,780
Master,

541
00:35:10,130 --> 00:35:10,900
could you give me

542
00:35:10,900 --> 00:35:12,010
a few more hints?

543
00:35:17,050 --> 00:35:19,420
When hardship ends,
fortune will return in time.

544
00:35:19,420 --> 00:35:21,950
A noble benefactor
will soon cross your path.

545
00:35:21,970 --> 00:35:24,500
When Dragon and Tiger
clash in the mountains,

546
00:35:24,820 --> 00:35:27,780
the reckless will eventually
encounter the worthy.

547
00:35:28,050 --> 00:35:29,610
The first half

548
00:35:30,170 --> 00:35:31,420
means

549
00:35:31,570 --> 00:35:32,740
a benefactor

550
00:35:32,860 --> 00:35:34,340
will appear soon.

551
00:35:35,380 --> 00:35:36,700
But the second half—

552
00:35:36,780 --> 00:35:38,700
"When Dragon and Tiger
clash in the mountains,

553
00:35:38,700 --> 00:35:42,260
the reckless will eventually
encounter the worthy" means...

554
00:35:42,740 --> 00:35:44,140
The time isn't right yet.

555
00:35:44,380 --> 00:35:45,380
Give it a few days,

556
00:35:45,740 --> 00:35:47,050
and you'll see.

557
00:36:00,050 --> 00:36:00,610
Honey,

558
00:36:01,170 --> 00:36:02,340
I had some wine.

559
00:36:02,530 --> 00:36:03,380
I won't keep you from resting.

560
00:36:03,380 --> 00:36:04,910
I'll sleep in the side room.

561
00:36:06,900 --> 00:36:09,700
Since when did you start
drinking Western liquor?

562
00:36:11,090 --> 00:36:12,650
A merchant from Nanyang

563
00:36:13,050 --> 00:36:14,580
named Shangguan Chengming

564
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:16,090
wants to do business with us.

565
00:36:16,090 --> 00:36:17,340
So I just had a couple of drinks with him.

566
00:36:17,340 --> 00:36:18,420
From Nanyang?

567
00:36:19,340 --> 00:36:22,070
What business could he
possibly discuss with us?

568
00:36:25,010 --> 00:36:25,870
Bashen Powder.

569
00:36:28,130 --> 00:36:29,060
What did you say?

570
00:36:30,340 --> 00:36:32,400
You told him about the Bashen Powder?

571
00:36:33,170 --> 00:36:34,130
He brought it up.

572
00:36:34,220 --> 00:36:36,130
How would he know if you didn't tell him?

573
00:36:36,130 --> 00:36:36,650
I

574
00:36:37,260 --> 00:36:37,970
had some wine,

575
00:36:37,970 --> 00:36:39,340
and one thing led to another, so I...

576
00:36:39,340 --> 00:36:40,670
I ended up admitting it.

577
00:36:40,740 --> 00:36:42,820
You just ignore what I said,

578
00:36:42,820 --> 00:36:43,610
don't you?

579
00:36:43,820 --> 00:36:44,880
Blind Du's hideout

580
00:36:44,900 --> 00:36:46,740
was just raided by Commander Feng.

581
00:36:46,740 --> 00:36:47,900
If they keep investigating,

582
00:36:47,900 --> 00:36:49,780
they'll be coming after us
in a matter of days.

583
00:36:49,780 --> 00:36:51,380
We should be keeping
our heads down right now.

584
00:36:51,380 --> 00:36:52,380
And you just had to

585
00:36:52,450 --> 00:36:54,250
walk right into the line of fire!

586
00:36:56,220 --> 00:36:57,300
Honey,

587
00:36:58,170 --> 00:36:59,570
I think Chengming

588
00:36:59,820 --> 00:37:01,050
is someone we can trust.

589
00:37:01,050 --> 00:37:02,380
The roads are blocked right now,

590
00:37:02,380 --> 00:37:03,570
and we can't get the goods out.

591
00:37:03,570 --> 00:37:04,780
If we can really sell them

592
00:37:04,780 --> 00:37:05,820
to Nanyang as he said,

593
00:37:05,820 --> 00:37:07,150
it would be great for us.

594
00:37:07,530 --> 00:37:08,650
Nanyang?

595
00:37:08,820 --> 00:37:10,970
We can't even get the goods out
of the province right now.

596
00:37:10,970 --> 00:37:12,170
And have you thought about this?

597
00:37:12,170 --> 00:37:13,380
If the Tianxiang Sect

598
00:37:13,490 --> 00:37:15,260
finds out about the Bashen Powder,

599
00:37:15,260 --> 00:37:17,170
do you think our family
will make it out alive?

600
00:37:17,170 --> 00:37:19,490
Isn't Blind Du from the Tianxiang Sect?

601
00:37:19,610 --> 00:37:20,530
Zhou Wenxin, oh,

602
00:37:20,530 --> 00:37:21,340
Zhou Wenxin.

603
00:37:21,610 --> 00:37:22,780
Will you ever learn?

604
00:37:23,010 --> 00:37:24,820
I've entrusted the family business
to you for so many years.

605
00:37:24,820 --> 00:37:26,300
Don't you know the rules
of the underworld?

606
00:37:26,300 --> 00:37:28,900
The Sect Master doesn't allow
his men to touch drugs.

607
00:37:28,900 --> 00:37:31,220
The Sect Master won't
even make money when he could?

608
00:37:31,220 --> 00:37:32,480
Can you use your brain?

609
00:37:32,610 --> 00:37:33,860
Can the money from running scams

610
00:37:33,860 --> 00:37:35,610
really compare to the profits from opium?

611
00:37:35,610 --> 00:37:37,130
Isn't the Sect Master's real concern

612
00:37:37,130 --> 00:37:38,860
that once his men
get involved with opium,

613
00:37:38,860 --> 00:37:40,990
they'll grow too powerful to control?

614
00:37:41,170 --> 00:37:41,780
Madam,

615
00:37:41,970 --> 00:37:43,450
I met Chengming today

616
00:37:43,780 --> 00:37:45,740
just to feel him out.

617
00:37:45,780 --> 00:37:47,940
He really has nothing to do
with the Tianxiang Sect.

618
00:37:47,940 --> 00:37:49,130
He came to us

619
00:37:49,130 --> 00:37:51,380
with 10 gold bars in hand.

620
00:37:51,860 --> 00:37:53,520
If we can really work together

621
00:37:53,530 --> 00:37:55,300
and sell the Bashen Powder in Nanyang,

622
00:37:55,300 --> 00:37:56,570
no one will be able to stop us.

623
00:37:56,570 --> 00:37:58,300
And I think Chengming

624
00:37:58,650 --> 00:38:00,650
has powerful connections in
both the underworld and the government.

625
00:38:00,650 --> 00:38:01,450
You think?

626
00:38:08,010 --> 00:38:09,170
He has connections

627
00:38:10,130 --> 00:38:10,930
on both sides?

628
00:38:15,130 --> 00:38:16,390
How about this, Honey?

629
00:38:16,420 --> 00:38:17,420
I'll ask him to come see you

630
00:38:17,420 --> 00:38:18,880
in the next couple of days.

631
00:38:18,940 --> 00:38:20,470
You should size him up, too.

632
00:38:27,450 --> 00:38:28,220
Wait.

633
00:38:29,700 --> 00:38:30,780
You forgot again.

634
00:38:33,970 --> 00:38:35,010
Incense ash in the same cup;

635
00:38:35,010 --> 00:38:36,170
fate on the same slip.

636
00:38:36,170 --> 00:38:37,900
Is that what you said before?

637
00:38:38,490 --> 00:38:39,620
Say the whole thing.

638
00:38:49,860 --> 00:38:50,990
Don't worry, Honey.

639
00:38:51,050 --> 00:38:51,940
Incense ash in the same cup;

640
00:38:51,940 --> 00:38:53,140
fate on the same slip.

641
00:38:54,820 --> 00:38:55,610
You'll sleep

642
00:38:56,050 --> 00:38:57,530
in the shrine tonight.

643
00:38:57,970 --> 00:38:59,220
Repent to the Buddha.

644
00:38:59,380 --> 00:39:00,860
Let him see

645
00:39:01,530 --> 00:39:03,260
whether you're truly sincere.

646
00:39:21,220 --> 00:39:23,340
Seriously, what's your plan now?

647
00:39:23,490 --> 00:39:24,900
She wants someone with military power.

648
00:39:24,900 --> 00:39:25,490
Where am I

649
00:39:25,490 --> 00:39:27,230
supposed to find someone like that?

650
00:39:27,230 --> 00:39:29,830
"Master Chang" can't keep this up
much longer.

651
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:32,860
You really are something, aren't you?

652
00:39:32,860 --> 00:39:35,260
Too much mutton
will give you too much heat.

653
00:39:36,220 --> 00:39:37,740
Just tell me straight.

654
00:39:37,940 --> 00:39:39,700
What are you really doing
at the Qian family?

655
00:39:39,700 --> 00:39:40,900
To pick something up.

656
00:39:41,490 --> 00:39:42,420
What?

657
00:39:43,450 --> 00:39:44,110
The ledger.

658
00:39:45,420 --> 00:39:47,950
Are you really going
to do business with them?

659
00:39:49,820 --> 00:39:51,080
Keep it under control,

660
00:39:51,300 --> 00:39:52,260
Master Chang.

661
00:39:56,330 --> 00:39:56,930
Take care.

662
00:40:25,820 --> 00:40:26,680
Second Master,

663
00:40:26,970 --> 00:40:28,430
someone is here to see you.

664
00:40:29,220 --> 00:40:30,950
A monk going to a Taoist priest?

665
00:40:31,420 --> 00:40:33,020
Something's definitely up.

666
00:40:48,050 --> 00:40:49,860
I want to make a deal with you.

667
00:40:50,220 --> 00:40:52,220
There's no need for this between us.

668
00:40:53,260 --> 00:40:56,530
I know what you need most right now
is money to pay your troops.

669
00:40:56,530 --> 00:40:57,820
I can help you get it.

670
00:41:00,780 --> 00:41:01,490
Please sit.

671
00:41:04,820 --> 00:41:06,950
I'm going to the Qian family tomorrow.

672
00:41:06,970 --> 00:41:08,260
This time, I'll be going

673
00:41:08,260 --> 00:41:09,130
by Jiang Shuyi.

674
00:41:09,220 --> 00:41:10,750
You're going there for him?

675
00:41:12,170 --> 00:41:13,130
Of course not.

676
00:41:13,570 --> 00:41:14,420
From now on,

677
00:41:14,970 --> 00:41:16,830
if you need anything in Qianshan,

678
00:41:18,090 --> 00:41:19,300
come to me.

679
00:41:24,260 --> 00:41:25,660
I just don't understand.

680
00:41:25,860 --> 00:41:27,790
If you help me get the military pay,

681
00:41:29,300 --> 00:41:30,490
what can I give you?

682
00:41:32,970 --> 00:41:34,300
Getting Commander Feng

683
00:41:34,420 --> 00:41:36,420
to owe me such a big favor is one thing.

684
00:41:36,420 --> 00:41:38,020
I'll have to think carefully

685
00:41:38,260 --> 00:41:40,190
about how to collect on it someday.

686
00:41:46,010 --> 00:41:46,340
Come.

687
00:41:46,420 --> 00:41:47,010
Chengming.

688
00:41:47,010 --> 00:41:47,740
Come on.

689
00:41:47,900 --> 00:41:48,970
Have a drink.

690
00:41:49,420 --> 00:41:51,080
I just like drinking with you.

691
00:41:54,780 --> 00:41:55,260
Bro.

692
00:41:55,900 --> 00:41:58,100
Didn't we agree to meet your wife today?

693
00:41:58,340 --> 00:41:59,390
If we keep drinking like this,

694
00:41:59,390 --> 00:42:00,530
we might not be in any shape to meet her.

695
00:42:00,530 --> 00:42:01,420
Chengming,

696
00:42:01,610 --> 00:42:03,270
there's a saying around here:

697
00:42:03,780 --> 00:42:07,490
It's more important to judge the person
than the money or the goods.

698
00:42:07,490 --> 00:42:08,740
You're a straightforward man.

699
00:42:08,740 --> 00:42:09,530
My wife asked me

700
00:42:09,530 --> 00:42:10,740
to take good care of you.

701
00:42:10,740 --> 00:42:12,470
She will come to meet you later.

702
00:42:13,380 --> 00:42:13,820
Here.

703
00:42:13,820 --> 00:42:14,900
Eat some food.

704
00:42:15,930 --> 00:42:16,420
Try this.

705
00:42:16,420 --> 00:42:17,020
Thank you.

706
00:42:22,010 --> 00:42:22,860
Chengming,

707
00:42:24,130 --> 00:42:25,050
listening to your accent,

708
00:42:25,050 --> 00:42:26,570
you're not actually
from Nanyang, are you?

709
00:42:26,570 --> 00:42:27,740
I was born in Jianghuai

710
00:42:27,740 --> 00:42:29,670
and went to Nanyang a few years ago.

711
00:42:30,260 --> 00:42:30,780
Well,

712
00:42:31,530 --> 00:42:33,340
it seems we are about the same age.

713
00:42:33,340 --> 00:42:34,670
What year were you born?

714
00:42:40,570 --> 00:42:41,090
Honey.

715
00:42:46,340 --> 00:42:47,140
Master Chang,

716
00:42:47,380 --> 00:42:49,380
this is a friend's
Four Pillars of Destiny.

717
00:42:49,380 --> 00:42:50,610
Please read it for me.

718
00:42:59,740 --> 00:43:00,530
Chengming.

719
00:43:01,860 --> 00:43:02,900
Mr. Chengming,

720
00:43:03,010 --> 00:43:04,650
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

721
00:43:04,650 --> 00:43:05,650
Third Madam Qian,

722
00:43:05,780 --> 00:43:06,650
I've heard a great deal about you.

723
00:43:06,650 --> 00:43:07,450
It's an honor

724
00:43:07,530 --> 00:43:08,530
to meet you today.

725
00:43:09,130 --> 00:43:11,130
We drank a bit too much last night.

726
00:43:11,260 --> 00:43:12,300
Please don't take it to heart.

727
00:43:12,300 --> 00:43:13,420
It's a small matter.

728
00:43:13,420 --> 00:43:14,620
Don't worry about it.

729
00:43:15,010 --> 00:43:16,420
Please sit down, and let's talk.

730
00:43:16,420 --> 00:43:17,340
Sit.

731
00:43:17,420 --> 00:43:18,220
Master Chang.

732
00:43:19,490 --> 00:43:21,290
Wenxin, pour tea for the guests.

733
00:43:25,340 --> 00:43:26,600
Who is this gentleman?

734
00:43:27,130 --> 00:43:28,590
I forgot to introduce you.

735
00:43:28,740 --> 00:43:30,700
This is Master Chang Youliang,

736
00:43:30,700 --> 00:43:32,220
the 13th-generation real person

737
00:43:32,220 --> 00:43:34,150
of Zijin Temple on Heyun Mountain.

738
00:43:34,570 --> 00:43:35,780
I heard of Master Chang of Zijin Temple

739
00:43:35,780 --> 00:43:37,980
on Heyun Mountain when I was in Nanyang.

740
00:43:38,380 --> 00:43:39,340
It's truly an honor

741
00:43:39,340 --> 00:43:40,340
to meet you today.

742
00:43:40,450 --> 00:43:41,260
If there's a chance,

743
00:43:41,260 --> 00:43:43,260
I hope you can give me some guidance.

744
00:43:43,260 --> 00:43:44,130
You flatter me.

745
00:43:44,420 --> 00:43:45,820
I won't hide it from you, sir.

746
00:43:45,820 --> 00:43:48,170
We've had some trouble at home recently.

747
00:43:48,860 --> 00:43:50,780
So I specially invited the Master
down the mountain

748
00:43:50,780 --> 00:43:51,910
to take a look for us.

749
00:43:52,490 --> 00:43:53,820
May I ask what happened?

750
00:43:54,170 --> 00:43:56,030
Is there anything I can help with?

751
00:43:56,700 --> 00:43:58,560
Actually, it was a few days ago...

752
00:44:00,650 --> 00:44:03,260
This is the finest Pu'er tea
we've had this year.

753
00:44:03,260 --> 00:44:04,060
Please try it.

754
00:44:04,260 --> 00:44:04,740
Okay.

755
00:44:04,900 --> 00:44:05,450
Master,

756
00:44:05,570 --> 00:44:06,300
please try it, too.

757
00:44:06,300 --> 00:44:06,780
Okay.

758
00:44:13,740 --> 00:44:14,900
Wenxin told me

759
00:44:15,220 --> 00:44:16,450
you had some ideas...

760
00:44:18,340 --> 00:44:20,610
about our family business.

761
00:44:21,220 --> 00:44:23,280
Why don't you tell me more about them?

762
00:44:24,860 --> 00:44:26,940
Since you've gotten straight to the point,

763
00:44:26,940 --> 00:44:28,940
I'll get straight to the point, too.

764
00:44:29,450 --> 00:44:31,510
I run a shipping business in Nanyang,

765
00:44:31,650 --> 00:44:33,380
and I have two shipping routes.

766
00:44:33,700 --> 00:44:34,740
My cargo ships

767
00:44:34,860 --> 00:44:35,650
make at least

768
00:44:35,740 --> 00:44:36,870
9 round trips a week.

769
00:44:37,130 --> 00:44:38,780
I'll handle the shipping both ways.

770
00:44:38,780 --> 00:44:39,740
We'll split the profits

771
00:44:39,740 --> 00:44:41,820
70-30.

772
00:44:42,220 --> 00:44:43,220
What do you think,

773
00:44:43,420 --> 00:44:44,300
Third Madam?

774
00:44:46,900 --> 00:44:48,380
You call the shots at sea.

775
00:44:50,340 --> 00:44:51,380
But...

776
00:44:51,700 --> 00:44:53,360
we're nowhere near the coast.

777
00:44:53,450 --> 00:44:55,300
Getting goods from the mountains
to the docks

778
00:44:55,300 --> 00:44:56,970
is a real ordeal.

779
00:44:58,450 --> 00:45:00,220
I don't know if you

780
00:45:00,380 --> 00:45:01,740
has what it takes.

781
00:45:02,610 --> 00:45:03,810
Cats have their ways,

782
00:45:04,050 --> 00:45:05,250
and dogs have theirs.

783
00:45:05,260 --> 00:45:06,740
Since I came all the way here

784
00:45:06,740 --> 00:45:08,090
to do business with you,

785
00:45:08,300 --> 00:45:09,570
whatever you're worried about

786
00:45:09,570 --> 00:45:10,380
is not

787
00:45:10,900 --> 00:45:12,010
a problem for me.

788
00:45:12,780 --> 00:45:13,780
I'm all ears.

789
00:45:14,780 --> 00:45:16,170
It's so lively today.

790
00:45:18,380 --> 00:45:19,710
Second Brother is back.

791
00:45:20,260 --> 00:45:21,390
We have guests here.

792
00:45:22,220 --> 00:45:23,420
Let me introduce you.

793
00:45:24,090 --> 00:45:25,970
This is Master Chang Youliang

794
00:45:26,170 --> 00:45:27,780
from Zijin Temple on Heyun Mountain.

795
00:45:27,780 --> 00:45:28,980
He's from Nanyang...

796
00:45:29,130 --> 00:45:30,420
My sister's believed in this sort of thing

797
00:45:30,420 --> 00:45:32,010
since she was a child.

798
00:45:32,410 --> 00:45:34,610
She considers herself
a spiritual practitioner.

799
00:45:34,610 --> 00:45:35,700
I think

800
00:45:36,090 --> 00:45:38,550
she'll end up becoming
a nun sooner or later.

801
00:45:38,970 --> 00:45:40,050
Life itself

802
00:45:40,570 --> 00:45:42,010
is a cultivation.

803
00:45:43,380 --> 00:45:44,900
Well said, Master.

804
00:45:45,450 --> 00:45:46,820
There's something

805
00:45:46,970 --> 00:45:48,530
I'd like you to read for me.

806
00:45:49,570 --> 00:45:50,650
Can you read

807
00:45:51,010 --> 00:45:52,140
between the two of us

808
00:45:53,780 --> 00:45:54,840
who calls the shots

809
00:45:55,300 --> 00:45:56,220
in this family?

810
00:45:56,700 --> 00:45:57,630
Second Brother.

811
00:45:58,490 --> 00:46:00,260
Since Third Madam has
family matters to deal with,

812
00:46:00,260 --> 00:46:01,790
I'll come back another day.

813
00:46:01,900 --> 00:46:03,360
Don't make it another day.

814
00:46:03,500 --> 00:46:05,430
Since the Master won't read for me,

815
00:46:05,970 --> 00:46:06,570
then

816
00:46:07,380 --> 00:46:08,780
I'll read yours instead.

817
00:46:11,780 --> 00:46:13,130
Young man,

818
00:46:13,820 --> 00:46:15,420
you have a compound surname,

819
00:46:15,740 --> 00:46:16,450
Shangguan.

820
00:46:17,490 --> 00:46:19,150
You're Shangguan Chengming,

821
00:46:19,650 --> 00:46:20,260
right?

822
00:46:21,650 --> 00:46:22,220
Master,

823
00:46:22,610 --> 00:46:24,010
was my reading accurate?

824
00:46:26,490 --> 00:46:27,420
Do you know

825
00:46:27,720 --> 00:46:29,110
how I read it out?

826
00:46:34,780 --> 00:46:35,650
Come in.

827
00:46:52,300 --> 00:46:53,610
You didn't expect this, did you?

828
00:46:53,610 --> 00:46:54,730
I'm still alive.

829
00:46:58,780 --> 00:47:01,030
[In the next episode]

830
00:47:01,170 --> 00:47:02,130
Miss Shuyi.

831
00:47:02,700 --> 00:47:03,570
Come in.

832
00:47:03,710 --> 00:47:04,910
Sect Master asked you

833
00:47:05,860 --> 00:47:06,990
when you would do it.

834
00:47:10,650 --> 00:47:11,440
Today.

835
00:47:17,000 --> 00:47:18,060
Second Madam Qian.

836
00:47:19,010 --> 00:47:21,010
You didn't invite me to the wedding?

837
00:47:21,940 --> 00:47:23,460
Let me introduce her.

838
00:47:24,160 --> 00:47:24,950
This is

839
00:47:25,050 --> 00:47:26,650
the woman I'm about to marry,

840
00:47:27,010 --> 00:47:27,780
Jiang Shuyi.

841
00:47:27,810 --> 00:47:30,170
I've only just met Mr. Chengming.

842
00:47:30,730 --> 00:47:31,980
Why would I have invited you?

843
00:47:31,980 --> 00:47:34,750
Whether you invited me or not,
I'm here now.

844
00:47:35,420 --> 00:47:37,420
I just wonder whether this marriage

845
00:47:37,420 --> 00:47:38,940
is real or not.
